%% TECH-008 Flaky box measurements
%% How a box is read in the design tests, and what the old read missed.
flowchart TD
    A[Test needs the size or position of an element] --> B[settledBox]
    B --> C{Visible?}
    C -- no --> C
    C -- yes --> D[Read the box twice, a frame apart]
    D --> E{Same box both times?}
    E -- "no: animating, re-rendered or moving" --> D
    E -- yes --> F[Compare with the limit]
